-- s 1076: replacement of a document
#ASSERT `s 1076(1) the registrar may accept a replacement for the document previously delivered` `s 1076(1)(a) a document that did not comply with the requirements for proper delivery` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 1076(1) the registrar may accept a replacement for the document previously delivered` `s 1076(1)(b) a document that contained unnecessary material (within the meaning of section 1074)` EQUALS JUST TRUE
