#ASSERT `s 1076(3) the registrar's power to impose requirements as to form and manner of delivery includes power to impose the requirement` `s 1076(3) another requirement` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 1076(4) this section applies to the original document` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 1076(4) this section applies to the original document` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

